Pre-Requisites
You must have the SPO-Service module installed in your local PowerShell

Connect to your O365 using the SPO-Service and Global Admin account

Update the Export path in the PS1 file to point to your local path for the output to save to.

Run script and it will generate a user list with OneDrives to be migrated for importing into BT OneDrive migration job.  

Very handy if you have mixed licenses on the source tenant and need to define which accounts you need to migrate OneDrives for BitTitan OneDrive project.